  "description": "A .NET 10 Backend-for-Frontend using YARP, standard OpenID Connect and Redis. Framework Data Protection encrypts server sessions and rotates data keys. Supports signed back-channel logout, coordinated refresh across replicas and host-owned OpenTelemetry. Compatible with OpenIddict.",
