  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New-deployment session format uses ASP.NET Core Data Protection with shared Redis keys and standard key rotation. No migration reader. Adds signed back-channel logout with configurable limits and atomic replay-safe deletion, read-only session inspection, consistent POST/Basic client authentication, composed OIDC events and built-in Meter/ActivitySource instrumentation. Redis/CAS/YARP architecture, browser API contracts and existing configuration defaults are retained.",
